---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const description =
	'Farida Sakr: data scientist working on causal inference and on measuring whether AI systems reach conclusions the data actually supports.';
---

<Layout title="Farida Sakr | Data Scientist" description={description}>
	<h1>Farida Sakr</h1>

	<p class="lede">
		Data scientist. I work on causal inference and on measuring whether AI systems reach
		conclusions the data actually supports.
	</p>

	<p>
		Most analytics questions look like they need a query and actually need an identification
		strategy. I build things that make the difference measurable: synthetic data with planted
		ground truth, so estimates and agents can be scored rather than argued about.
	</p>

	<section id="work" aria-labelledby="work-heading" class="work">
		<h2 id="work-heading">Work</h2>

		<article class="card">
			<h3><a href="/work/promo-causal">A promo that looked like $23 per customer made $6</a></h3>
			<p class="result">
				A naive difference in means overstated a free-shipping promotion's effect by 3.6×.
				Cross-fitted AIPW recovered the planted truth to within 9%, and the economics flipped
				the recommendation.
			</p>
			<p class="card-links">
				<a href="/work/promo-causal">Case study</a>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/faridasakr/ecommerce-promo-causal"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">Code<span class="ext" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
				>
				<a
					href="https://ecommerce-promo-causal-k8unq4zcnx7cspfo3ru8f4.streamlit.app"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">Live demo<span class="ext" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
				>
			</p>
		</article>

		<article class="card">
			<h3>
				<a href="/work/agent-bench">Does agentic complexity actually beat a fixed workflow?</a>
			</h3>
			<p class="result">
				A benchmark that grades an analytics agent's conclusions against known causal truth: not
				whether the SQL ran, but whether the answer was right and whether it overclaimed.
			</p>
			<p class="card-links">
				<a href="/work/agent-bench">Case study</a>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/faridasakr/ecommerce-analytics-agent"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">Code<span class="ext" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
				>
			</p>
		</article>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.work {
		margin-top: 3.5rem;
	}

	.work > h2 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--muted);
	}

	.card {
		border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
		padding-block: 1.75rem;
	}

	.card:last-child {
		padding-bottom: 0;
	}

	.card h3 {
		font-size: 1.375rem;
		margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
	}

	.card h3 a {
		color: var(--fg);
		text-decoration-color: var(--rule);
	}

	.card h3 a:hover {
		text-decoration-color: var(--accent);
	}

	.result {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		color: var(--muted);
	}

	.card-links {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.4rem 1.25rem;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
	}
</style>
